     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Richard,<div><br></div><div>Thank you very much for the help! I would not be progressing at all without help from this forum. My final code is posted below:</div><div><br></div><div><div>#Finite Occupancy Estimate</div><div>  re=ranef(fm1)</div></div></div>"
